684	     * after this create. Because {@code householdId} is derived from the owner's {@code lastName}
685	     * and {@code postcode} (see {@link #assignHouseholdId}), the count reflects every
686	     * owner registered to the same household, including those who joined via {@code sharesHousehold}.
687	     * The count is taken before this owner is persisted, so it is one more than the number of
688	     * existing household members.
