718	    /**
719	     * Assigns the owner's {@code membershipNumber} on create, formatted
720	     * {@code '<customerCode>-M<YY>'} where customerCode is the owner's already-assigned customer
721	     * code and YY is the last two digits of the {@code registrationDate}'s fiscal year (which
722	     * starts on 1 July), zero-padded (e.g. {@code 'NSW-A1B2C3D4-M27'}). The YY segment therefore
723	     * matches the owner's {@code fiscalYear}. Derived purely from the owner's own fields, so both
724	     * {@link #assignCustomerCode} and {@link #defaultRegistrationDate} must run first.
725	     *
726	     * @param owner the owner being created (with its {@code customerCode} and
727	     *              {@code registrationDate} already set)
