741	    /**
742	     * Assigns the owner's {@code bulkSignupWarning} on create: {@code true} when more than
743	     * {@link #BULK_SIGNUP_WARNING_THRESHOLD} owners already carry this owner's (business-day
744	     * adjusted) {@code registrationDate}, otherwise {@code false}. The count is taken over the
745	     * existing owners before this one is persisted, so it reflects only the owners already
