901	    /**
902	     * Rejects a create once {@link #DAILY_LIMIT} or more owners already carry the given adjusted
903	     * business day as their {@code registrationDate}. The day counted against is this create's
904	     * effective registration date after the business-day roll (see {@link #defaultRegistrationDate}),
905	     * so owners are counted per adjusted business day. The count is taken before this owner is
906	     * persisted.
