299	    /**
300	     * The owner's membership points, derived on read from the fields assigned at create. Points
301	     * start at 0 and accumulate: 2 when an email is present, 1 when {@code namesakeCount} is 0,
302	     * 2 when the household has 3 or more members ({@code householdMemberCount} of 3 or more), and
303	     * 3 when the owner's tenure spans at least one elapsed fiscal year. Tenure is the number of
304	     * fiscal years (which start on 1 July) elapsed between the {@code registrationDate} and the
305	     * current date. Because a newly created owner has zero tenure, the tenure points are only
306	     * earned once the owner has entered a later fiscal year than the one they registered in.
307	     *
308	     * @return the membership points, 0 or more
309	     */
310	    @Transient
